        "Level": "beginner",
        "ContentType": "diaries",
        "Topic": "Kh\u00E1m ph\u00E1",
        "SourceType": "original-20261114",
        "PreviewText": "Nh\u1EADt k\u00FD v\u1EC1 m\u1ED9t v\u1EADt tr\u01B0ng b\u00E0y g\u1EE3i chuy\u1EC7n trong gia \u0111\u00ECnh.",
        "IsPublished": true
